ncial_Affidavit_for_Applicant_Studying_in_Korea.docx\"\u003E붙임양식 3\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E4\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E번역자 확인서 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\u003Ca href=\"\u002Fstorage\u002Fpublic\u002Fdocs\u002FKIT%20Form_4%20Verification%20of%20Translation.docx\"\u003E붙임양식 4\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E5\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E개인정보 수집, 이용 및 제3자 제공동의서 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\u003Ca href=\"\u002Fstorage\u002Fpublic\u002Fdocs\u002FKIT%20Form_5%20Personal%20Information%20Collection%20Usage%20Third-Party%20Disclosure%20Consent.docx\"\u003E붙임양식 5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E6\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E기숙사 이용 신청서 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\u003Ca href=\"\u002Fstorage\u002Fpublic\u002Fdocs\u002FKIT%20Form_6%20Application%20for%20Dormitory.docx\"\u003E붙임양식 6\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E7\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E사진(3.5cm× 4.5cm) 5장\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\n                                    \t\u003Cul\u003E\n                                         \t\u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E최근 6개월 이내 촬영분\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                    \t\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E8\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E최종학교 졸업증명서 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd rowspan=\"2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\n                                    \t\u003Cul\u003E\n                                         \t\u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E① 출신국 아포스티유(Apostille) \n   확인을 받은 증명서\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                         \t\u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003E② 출신국 영사 확인을 받은 확인\n                                         \t  서 또는 주한 공관의 \n                                         \t  영사 확인서\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                    \t\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E원본 제출\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E9\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E최종학교 전과정 성적증명서 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E원본 제출\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E10\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E한국어능력시험(TOPIK) 2급 이상, 세종학당 초급2 과정 이상(단, 온라인 세종학당 제외), KIIP(법무부 사회통합프그램) 2단계 이상 또는 사전평가 41점 이상 성적증명서\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\n                                    \t\u003Cul\u003E\n                                       \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E 접수일 기준 유효기간(2년) 준수\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                    \t\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E11\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E본인 여권 사본 1부\u003Cbr\u003E외국인등록증(국내 거주자) 사본 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\n                                    \t\u003Cul\u003E\n                                       \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E여권 인적사항 부분\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                         \t\u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003E 외국인등록증 앞, 뒤 사본\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                    \t\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E12\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E가족관계 증명서 및 번역본 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E13\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E부모의 신분증 또는 여권 사본 각 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E14\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E부모 재직증명서 및 수입증명 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E15\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E 재정보증서류(은행잔고증명) 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\n                                    \t\u003Cul\u003E\n                                       \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E3개월 이상의 유효기간\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                    \t\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E16\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E건강검진 증명서 1부\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\n                                    \t\u003Cul\u003E\n                                       \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E결핵, B형간염 결과 반드시 포함\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                               \t  \u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E17\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E임대계약서 사본\n  (없을 경우, 거주 숙소 제공 사실확인서)\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E※ 기숙사 미신청자\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E18\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E국민건강보험 납입증명서\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E※ 국내 거주자\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Ftbody\u003E\n                        \u003C\u002Ftable\u003E\n                    \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n                    \n                    \u003Ch3 class=\"h3style1\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E제출 서류 유의 사항\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n                    \u003Cul class=\"admission-cost\"\u003E\n                        \u003Cli data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E제출서류를 사전에 e-mail(oia@kit.ac.kr)로 송부하여 확인 후 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                        \u003Cli data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E외국에서 발급받은 서류는 원본을 제출\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E해야 하며, 한국어나 영어로 작성되지 않은 서류는 \u003Cstrong\u003E한글 또는 영문 번역문과 공증서류\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E를 첨부해야 합니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E                        \n                        \u003Cli\u003E15번 재정보증서류 : 본인 또는 재정보증인 명의로 US $16,000 (KRW1,600만원) 이상을 은행 등에 예치된 예금 잔액증명서 (원서 접수일 기준 3개월 이내 발급)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                        \u003Cli\u003E 8번과 9번의 서류는 아포스티유 가입국이 아닌 경우, 반드시 해당국 영사인증 또는 주한 공관의 영사인증 등 공증을 거친 원본 서류를 제출해야 합니다. \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                        \u003Cli\u003E제출서류 이외에 자격 심사를 위하여 필요한 서류를 추가로 요구할 수 있습니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                    \u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n                \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n                \u003Cdiv class=\"tab-invisible\"\u003E\n           \t\t  \u003Ch2 class=\"h2style2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E합격자 선발 방법\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n               \t  \t\u003Cp class=\"pointb content-margin-left\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E서류 심사를 실시하고 필요시 면접 평가를 통해 종합적으로 판단하여 합격자를 선발함\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n                    \u003Cdiv class=\"table-wrap content-margin-left-bottom\"\u003E\n                        \u003Ctable class=\"iphak-table-style3 table-w800\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccaption class=\"invisible\"\u003E\n                            합격자 선발 방법\n                            \u003C\u002Fcaption\u003E\n                            \u003Ccolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:15%;\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:12%;\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:53%;\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:20%;\"\u003E\n                           \u003C\u002Fcolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Cthead\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E구분\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E배점\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E세부배점\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E비고\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Fthead\u003E\n                            \u003Ctbody\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E서류심사\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E50점\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E유학계획서(10점), 최종학교 성적(10점), 최종학교 출결(10점), 경제력(10점), 기타(10점)\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E30점 이상자 면접고사 실시\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E면접고사\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E50점\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E한국어학습 계획 및 목표(20점), 유학 목적의식(10점), 희망전공 및 졸업 후 계획(10점), 면접태도(10점)\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E30점 이상자 합격자 사정\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ctr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cth scope=\"col\" class=\"head-color2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E계\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \u003Cth scope=\"col\" class=\"head-color2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E100점\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cth scope=\"col\" class=\"head-color2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cth scope=\"col\" class=\"head-color2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Ftbody\u003E\n                        \u003C\u002Ftable\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cp class=\"point2 content-margin-bottom\"\u003E※ 서류위조 및 변조 등으로 인해 입학 전·후 확인되면 학칙 등에 따라 재입학 불가하며 관계 법령에 따라 조치가 될 수 있음\u003Cbr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t  ※ 대학 자체 한국어능력시험 통과자는 지원 학기만 인정됨\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n               \t  \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n                    \n               \t  \u003Ch2 class=\"h2style2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E합격자 등록\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n                    \u003Cul class=\"admission-cost content-margin-bottom\"\u003E\n                        \u003Cli data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E가. 등록금을 납부하여야만 최종 합격이 됩니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                        \u003Cli data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E나. 등록기간 내에 등록을 하지 않은 합격자는 합격을 포기한 것으로 간주합니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                    \u003C\u002Ful\u003E \n                    \n                    \u003Ch2 class=\"h2style2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E장학금 제도\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n                  \u003Cdiv class=\"table-wrap content-margin-bottom\"\u003E\n                        \u003Ctable class=\"iphak-table-style3 table-w800\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccaption class=\"invisible\"\u003E\n                            문의처\n                            \u003C\u002Fcaption\u003E\n                            \u003Ccolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:20%;\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:80%;\"\u003E\n                           \u003C\u002Fcolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Cthead\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E구분\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E장학금액\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Fthead\u003E\n                            \u003Ctbody\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd rowspan=\"2\" class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E해외인재\n양성장학\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E▣ TOPIK 및 사회통합프로그램 기준 감면율(매학기 적용)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \u003Cul\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003ETOPIK 2급(사회통합프로그램 2단계, 세종학당 초급2) : 20% 감면\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003ETOPIK 3급(사회통합프로그램 3단계, 세종학당 중급1) : 30% 감면\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003ETOPIK 4급(사회통합프로그램 4단계-기본과정, 세종학당 중급2) : 50% 감면\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003ETOPIK 5급(사회통합프로그램 5단계-심화과정, 세종학당 고급1) : 80% 감면\u003Cbr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t(단, 국내 고등학교 졸업자는 TOPIK 4급 이상 시 40% 감면)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003E※ 단, 두번째 학기 부터는 직전학기 학업성적 평점 C(2.0)이상 유지의 경우 지급함\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                  \u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E▣ 기타 조건별 감면\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cul\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E외국 국적의 학생 : 입학 시 첫 학기 수업료 20% 감면\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003EKIT 한국어학당 연계 진학생 및 교환학생 : 첫학기 수업료 50% 감면\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                   \t  \u003Cli class=\"dash-line\"\u003E※ 상기 조건은 중복적용 불가.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                                  \u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Ftbody\u003E\n                        \u003C\u002Ftable\u003E\n                \t\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n                    \n                    \n                    \u003Ch2 class=\"h2style2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E등록금\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n                    \u003Cdiv class=\"table-wrap content-margin-bottom\"\u003E\n                        \u003Ctable class=\"iphak-table-style3 table-small\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccaption class=\"invisible\"\u003E\n                            문의처\n                            \u003C\u002Fcaption\u003E\n                            \u003Ccolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:77%;\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:23%;\"\u003E\n                           \u003C\u002Fcolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Cthead\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E모집학과\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E등록금\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Fthead\u003E\n                            \u003Ctbody\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E반도체전자과, 전기과, 기계과, 전기수소자동차과, 화공에너지공학과, AI컴퓨터과, 인테리어디자인과, 토목환경과, 환경조경디자인과, 미디어영상과, 소방안전관리과, 신발패션과, 헤어디자인과, 글로벌K뷰티학과, K뷰티스타일리스트과, 스포츠재활트레이닝과, AI시각디자인학과\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E3,566,740원\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E호텔외식조리학과, 호텔제과제빵과(3년제)\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E3,555,440원\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E호텔관광과, AI창업학과\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E3,499,940원\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E병원의료행정과\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E3,467,040원\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E경영학과, 사회복지학과, 경찰행정학과\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                  \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E3,265,440원\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Ftbody\u003E\n                        \u003C\u002Ftable\u003E\n                \t\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n                   \n                \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n                \n                \u003Cdiv  class=\"hidden\"\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ch2 class=\"h2style2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E지원자 유의 사항\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n                    \u003Cul class=\"admission-cost content-margin-bottom\"\u003E\n                      \u003Cli data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E가. 제출된 서류는 반환하지 않으며, 지원 학과는 변경할 수 없습니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                      \u003Cli\u003E나. 전형 기간 중 모든 공지 사항(합격자 발표 포함)은 개별 통보합니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                      \u003Cli\u003E다. 구비 서류 미비, 기재상의 착오 및 누락, 모집요강에서의 요구사항 불이행, 주소의 불명, 연락 두절, 합격자 명단의 미확인, 입국 수속 절차 불이행 등으로 인한 불이익(합격 취소 등)은 지원자의 책임이므로 유의하여야 합니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                      \u003Cli\u003E라. 입학 원서 등 제출 서류 미비 또는 기재 사항이 사실과 다르거나 서류의 위·변조, 번역 오류, 대리시험 또는 부정행위자는 불합격 처리합니다. 또한 입학 후 부정한 방법으로 합격한 사실이 발견될 경우는 입학을 취소하며, 졸업한 후에라도 학적 말소 조치합니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                      \u003Cli\u003E마. 기타 모집요강에 명시되지 않은 사항은 우리대학 입학전형 절차와 학사규정에 따라 처리하며, 자세한 사항은 우리대학 입학지원처에 문의하시기 바랍니다.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n                    \u003C\u002Ful\u003E \n                    \u003Ch2 class=\"h2style2\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E문의처\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n                    \u003Cdiv class=\"table-wrap content-margin-left-bottom\"\u003E\n                        \u003Ctable class=\"iphak-table-style3 table-small\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccaption class=\"invisible\"\u003E\n                            문의처\n                            \u003C\u002Fcaption\u003E\n                            \u003Ccolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:40%;\"\u003E\n                            \u003Ccol style=\"width:60%;\"\u003E\n                           \u003C\u002Fcolgroup\u003E\n                            \u003Cthead\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E담당부서 \u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                    \u003Cth scope=\"col\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E연락처\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Fthead\u003E\n                            \u003Ctbody\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E국제교류처\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E전화 : +82-51-320-1460 \u002F 팩스 : +82-51-328-9551 \u002F \n 이메일 : oia@kit.ac.kr\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E입학지원처\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E 전화 : +82-51-320-1227 \u002F 팩스 : +82-51-312-1009\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                                \u003Ctr\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd class=\"text-center\" data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E대학 주소\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                    \u003Ctd data-gc-type=\"text\"\u003E 우)47011 부산광역시 사상구 주례로 45\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\n                                \u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\n                            \u003C\u002Ftbody\u003E\n                        \u003C\u002Ftable\u003E\n                 \n                \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n                \n                \u003C!--div  class=\"hidden\"\u003E\n                 \n                \u003C\u002Fdiv--\u003E\n             \n            \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","2026-09-02 15:32:58","@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .iphak-navigation-wrap nav\u003Eul\u003Eli\u003Eul\u003Eli\u003Ea {\n        padding: .2rem 1rem .2rem 2rem;\n    }\n}",857,"2026-09-07","2026-09-30","2027학년도 수시1차 원서접수","2026-01-27 10:11:46","2026-01-27 10:13:50","2026-09-25","2026-01-27 10:14:30"));</script><script src="/_nuxt/app.60b21eb320a98efed970.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/127.0125637b5bf5c84ed54a.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/0.67a35e2f6846016119d1.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/148.cd800ef41b154be6ea5e.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/210.54619ab939295aaca197.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/98.c9137d5bfcbcc68c395e.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/209.f01173a37e799f55585a.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/97.05157f5c8ff08410f9a2.js" defer></script>
